1
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,840
♪Amid the sea of faces♪

2
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:13,720
♪Our eyes meet by chance♪

3
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:17,080
♪Through the restless years♪

4
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:20,560
♪Time suddenly slows♪

5
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:24,000
♪No vows need be made♪

6
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:26,360
♪Though seas and mountains lie ahead♪

7
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:29,440
♪One glance says it all♪

8
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:32,880
♪Beyond a thousand words♪

9
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:37,280
♪With you by my side♪

10
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:40,400
♪I dare brave a thousand trials♪

11
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:43,680
♪Though mist may veil the road ahead♪

12
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:47,080
♪Hand in hand, no counting years♪

13
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:50,320
♪With you by my side♪

14
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:53,880
♪No need to speak my heart at length♪

15
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:57,200
♪As rivers and mountains change♪

16
00:00:57,720 --> 00:00:59,360
♪May we remain together♪

17
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:03,520
♪From dawn to dusk♪

18
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:07,000
=Daughter of a Concubine=

19
00:01:07,120 --> 00:01:09,920
=Episode 10=

20
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:12,960
(Cheng Residence)

21
00:01:14,959 --> 00:01:15,760
Aunt.

22
00:01:15,959 --> 00:01:17,040
This man claims

23
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:19,280
he carried on with my sister
back in the Xia house.

24
00:01:19,519 --> 00:01:20,959
She wasn't chaste before marriage,

25
00:01:20,959 --> 00:01:22,519
and unfit to be a Cheng bride.

26
00:01:28,319 --> 00:01:30,040
Is what she said true?

27
00:01:30,799 --> 00:01:31,920
Madam.

28
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:34,760
My name is Liu San,
a former guard for the Xia household.

29
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:36,519
Young Madam...

30
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:37,519
No, I mean

31
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:39,680
the Xia family's second daughter.

32
00:01:39,799 --> 00:01:41,159
When she was at the Xia Residence,

33
00:01:41,319 --> 00:01:42,760
she and I...

34
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:46,959
So you lost your virtue
before marriage, you wretch.

35
00:01:47,239 --> 00:01:48,040
Sister.

36
00:01:48,359 --> 00:01:50,120
The Cheng family mustn't
take in such a woman.

37
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:51,840
She shames us all.

38
00:01:53,879 --> 00:01:54,879
Lady Xia.

39
00:01:55,519 --> 00:01:56,799
What do you have to say?

40
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:19,599
You say you carried on with me.

41
00:02:19,639 --> 00:02:20,840
Then tell me.

42
00:02:21,159 --> 00:02:23,520
When did it happen?

43
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:24,400
And where?

44
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:26,400
What color was I wearing?

45
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:27,039
Well...

46
00:02:27,039 --> 00:02:28,479
It was three years ago,

47
00:02:28,599 --> 00:02:30,560
in the Xia family's back garden.

48
00:02:31,039 --> 00:02:31,840
At night.

49
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:33,560
It was too dark.

50
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:35,280
I couldn't make out the color.

51
00:02:35,599 --> 00:02:37,240
You couldn't see the color?

52
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:39,879
Surely you saw something else.

53
00:02:42,039 --> 00:02:42,840
I did.

54
00:02:44,039 --> 00:02:45,080
A birthmark.

55
00:02:46,319 --> 00:02:48,319
You have a birthmark on your back.

56
00:02:48,479 --> 00:02:50,159
I saw it with my own eyes.

57
00:03:08,879 --> 00:03:09,800
Mother.

58
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,879
I have a request.

59
00:03:11,879 --> 00:03:12,680
Go ahead.

60
00:03:12,879 --> 00:03:14,400
Let Young General examine me.

61
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:16,919
If he says I'm not chaste,

62
00:03:17,039 --> 00:03:18,159
I'll accept my punishment.

63
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:20,639
Mingzhi.

64
00:03:20,639 --> 00:03:21,520
Take her.

65
00:03:25,960 --> 00:03:27,120
Yes, Mother.

66
00:03:53,719 --> 00:03:54,639
Mother.

67
00:03:54,639 --> 00:03:55,680
I've examined her.

68
00:03:56,319 --> 00:03:57,840
Yunyi is chaste.

69
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,680
Liar.

70
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:01,360
You're her husband.

71
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:02,319
Of course you'd defend her.

72
00:04:02,319 --> 00:04:04,280
I said I examined her, and I did.

73
00:04:06,319 --> 00:04:07,199
Aunt.

74
00:04:07,199 --> 00:04:08,719
May a matron examine her instead?

75
00:04:08,919 --> 00:04:09,520
Fine.

76
00:04:10,879 --> 00:04:11,800
Mother.

77
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:13,039
The matron may examine me.

78
00:04:13,479 --> 00:04:14,879
But once she's done,

79
00:04:14,879 --> 00:04:16,839
if it proves I told the truth,

80
00:04:18,959 --> 00:04:20,399
Xia Yunshu,

81
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:21,720
you slandered your sister.

82
00:04:21,759 --> 00:04:22,800
What's the punishment?

83
00:04:24,519 --> 00:04:25,519
Whatever you decide.

84
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:32,240
Nanny Li.

85
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:33,000
Go examine her.

86
00:04:48,319 --> 00:04:49,680
Young Madam.

87
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,519
Please.

88
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:38,399
Xia Yunyi is chaste.

89
00:05:42,639 --> 00:05:43,920
Miss Yunyi.

90
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:44,839
Tell me,

91
00:05:44,839 --> 00:05:47,040
what will they do to us next?

92
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:48,279
Have you forgotten?

93
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:50,079
Back in the Xia household,

94
00:05:50,199 --> 00:05:53,680
how Madam Wang and her daughter
framed that maid for adultery?

95
00:05:54,839 --> 00:05:56,600
How could I forget?

96
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:59,920
After that maid was driven out,

97
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:01,279
she drowned herself in a well.

98
00:06:01,279 --> 00:06:02,560
Same old trick.

99
00:06:03,240 --> 00:06:05,560
And the surest way to ruin me.

100
00:06:07,439 --> 00:06:08,959
(All those years in the Xia household)

101
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:11,360
(taught me one thing.)

102
00:06:12,079 --> 00:06:14,519
(Don't wait for others to strike
before I act.)

103
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:16,600
(You should block the road in advance.)

104
00:06:17,079 --> 00:06:18,160
Miss Yunyi.

105
00:06:18,519 --> 00:06:20,040
Bear with it.

106
00:06:22,079 --> 00:06:22,839
Xia Yunyi!

107
00:06:22,839 --> 00:06:23,279
You...

108
00:06:23,279 --> 00:06:24,000
Sister.

109
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:25,560
You had someone frame me,

110
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:27,519
yet you don't even know
what's on my body.

111
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:30,319
Your little show has failed.

112
00:06:30,319 --> 00:06:31,560
I don't believe it.

113
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:32,480
Show me.

114
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:33,480
Let me see!

115
00:06:37,279 --> 00:06:38,079
Enough!

116
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:43,959
Xia Yunshu.

117
00:06:44,879 --> 00:06:46,560
We have both witness and evidence.

118
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:47,879
What do you have to say?

119
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:49,600
Aunt.

120
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:50,720
I had no idea.

121
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:51,519
It's this man...

122
00:06:51,519 --> 00:06:52,720
He deceived me!

123
00:06:53,759 --> 00:06:54,439
You...

124
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:58,439
Madam!

125
00:06:58,439 --> 00:06:59,720
It wasn't Second Young Madam's fault.

126
00:06:59,839 --> 00:07:01,040
It was me.

127
00:07:01,399 --> 00:07:02,959
I bribed this man

128
00:07:02,959 --> 00:07:04,560
to frame Young Madam.

129
00:07:04,560 --> 00:07:06,279
Second Young Madam knew nothing.

130
00:07:06,759 --> 00:07:08,800
So it was you, you wretched maid!

131
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:09,519
Do you know

132
00:07:09,519 --> 00:07:11,360
you nearly ruined Yunshu's virtue?

133
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,639
Why would you do this?

134
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:14,600
Cuixi...

135
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:18,399
I...

136
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:21,279
I hate Young Madam.

137
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:22,600
Back in the Xia household,

138
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:24,199
she always bullied Second Young Madam.

139
00:07:24,199 --> 00:07:26,040
I thought it was unfair!

140
00:07:26,759 --> 00:07:27,600
Cuixi.

141
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:29,680
You served my sister ten years
in the Xia household.

142
00:07:29,759 --> 00:07:31,079
I believe you hate me.

143
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:33,920
But how did you find this man?

144
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:36,720
He's a guard of the Xia household.

145
00:07:36,759 --> 00:07:39,279
How would a handmaiden
get in touch with him?

146
00:07:39,279 --> 00:07:40,279
How did you bribe him?

147
00:07:40,519 --> 00:07:41,879
Where did the silver come from?

148
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:46,839
Guards.

149
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:49,319
Take Liu San away.

150
00:07:49,639 --> 00:07:51,680
Find out who put him up to this.

151
00:07:52,279 --> 00:07:53,000
Madam.

152
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:53,639
It wasn't me!

153
00:07:53,639 --> 00:07:54,720
It was me.

154
00:07:55,079 --> 00:07:55,680
Madam!

155
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:03,000
What's going on?

156
00:08:16,879 --> 00:08:17,680
Deadly poison.

157
00:08:21,079 --> 00:08:23,439
Madam, he's been poisoned and is dead.

158
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:31,600
Sister.

159
00:08:31,879 --> 00:08:33,360
Why are you looking at me?

160
00:08:33,639 --> 00:08:35,159
I don't even know this man.

161
00:08:40,399 --> 00:08:43,440
Take Cuixi out and
give her forty strokes.

162
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:46,240
Cuixi...

163
00:08:46,399 --> 00:08:47,279
Cuixi!

164
00:08:47,279 --> 00:08:48,279
Xia Yunshu.

165
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:51,080
You failed to discipline your servant.

166
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:54,320
You let your maid slander your sister.

167
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:55,840
You'll be confined for a month

168
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:58,440
and copy "Lessons for Women"
a hundred times.

169
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:00,639
Yes.

170
00:09:02,039 --> 00:09:03,000
You may all leave.

171
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:32,360
Why didn't you examine me in the hall?

172
00:09:33,879 --> 00:09:35,039
Because I trust you.

173
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:38,519
Aren't you afraid I lied?

174
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:39,919
No.

175
00:09:42,519 --> 00:09:45,480
If I can't believe you in this house,

176
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:47,600
who else can you rely on?

177
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:52,120
Thank you.

178
00:10:08,799 --> 00:10:10,279
I have urgent business.
I'll be gone a few days.

179
00:10:11,039 --> 00:10:12,080
Be careful.

180
00:10:27,519 --> 00:10:28,240
Careful.

181
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:28,879
Cuixi.

182
00:10:31,759 --> 00:10:33,279
You've cared for me all these years,

183
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,919
and now you took the blame for me.

184
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:38,240
You've suffered enough.

185
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:42,000
It's all right, My Lady.

186
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,279
I don't mind.

187
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,759
I did it willingly.

188
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:48,399
Careful!

189
00:10:48,399 --> 00:10:49,080
Stand still.

190
00:10:51,919 --> 00:10:53,240
This is your deed of release.

191
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:54,919
From now on,

192
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:56,759
you're no longer a servant
of the Xia household.

193
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:58,080
You're my sworn sister.

194
00:10:58,280 --> 00:11:00,200
(Deed of Release, Xia Yunshu)

195
00:11:01,919 --> 00:11:02,919
Don't kneel.

196
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:03,919
Get up.

197
00:11:04,879 --> 00:11:06,159
You never have to kneel again.

198
00:11:06,399 --> 00:11:07,559
You're my sister now.

199
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:09,240
My Lady...

200
00:11:10,879 --> 00:11:11,799
Don't cry.

201
00:11:11,799 --> 00:11:12,480
Silly girl.

202
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:15,159
(That girl knows how to win hearts.)

203
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:29,480
(Huichun Pharmacy)

204
00:11:52,759 --> 00:11:53,559
(Mother...)

205
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:55,639
(Mother...)

206
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:57,480
(Is that you, Mother?)

207
00:12:01,679 --> 00:12:02,480
(Mother...)

208
00:12:03,679 --> 00:12:04,720
(Mother...)

209
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:06,240
(Where are you going?)

210
00:12:06,240 --> 00:12:07,759
Mother!

211
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:24,240
(Cheng Residence)

212
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:28,720
Miss Yunyi.

213
00:12:29,960 --> 00:12:31,320
Today,

214
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:33,240
I went to the pharmacy.

215
00:12:33,559 --> 00:12:35,080
I uncovered something.

216
00:12:35,159 --> 00:12:36,200
What did you find?

217
00:12:36,360 --> 00:12:39,639
Your mother often went to that pharmacy.

218
00:12:39,639 --> 00:12:41,360
She wasn't there for treatment.

219
00:12:41,799 --> 00:12:43,399
She was investigating a medicine.

220
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:44,679
What medicine?

221
00:12:45,279 --> 00:12:47,440
It's called aconite.

222
00:12:47,879 --> 00:12:52,120
I copied down the prescription today.

223
00:12:53,799 --> 00:12:55,120
(Cold-Dampness Remedy)
The physician told me

224
00:12:55,279 --> 00:12:56,919
aconite is highly poisonous.

225
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:58,559
Those claimed by this poison

226
00:12:59,080 --> 00:13:01,039
shall have black nails

227
00:13:01,080 --> 00:13:02,480
and purple lips.

228
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:04,120
It's a terrible way to die.

229
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:10,000
And the poison found in
Third Madam's room was aconite.

230
00:13:15,879 --> 00:13:19,200
When did my mother
last visit the pharmacy?

231
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:20,559
Just last month.

232
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:23,120
The physician said
she seemed quite happy.

233
00:13:23,840 --> 00:13:24,919
Just as I thought.

234
00:13:25,759 --> 00:13:27,240
My mother may have discovered

235
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:29,559
who framed Third Madam back then.

236
00:13:30,600 --> 00:13:32,000
That's why she was killed.

237
00:13:35,519 --> 00:13:36,879
Now that we've come this far,

238
00:13:37,799 --> 00:13:39,639
someone is bound to make a move.

239
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:47,320
(Xia Yunyi did this to me.)

240
00:14:07,080 --> 00:14:12,480
♪Let the past be buried in the wind♪

241
00:14:14,020 --> 00:14:18,260
♪Perhaps the waning moon knows my pain♪

242
00:14:19,100 --> 00:14:22,660
♪It sees the old tenderness
all come to nothing♪

243
00:14:23,260 --> 00:14:25,940
♪How many regrets haunt this world♪

244
00:14:26,620 --> 00:14:32,060
♪By the window, whose dreams flicker
by the dying candle♪

245
00:14:34,500 --> 00:14:38,660
♪Things remain, you're gone,
and I'm still dazed♪

246
00:14:40,220 --> 00:14:42,020
♪The sandstorm in my eyes♪

247
00:14:42,620 --> 00:14:45,380
♪Turns to a blade's edge♪
(Cheng Residence)

248
00:14:47,060 --> 00:14:48,380
♪Cutting through old years♪

249
00:14:48,940 --> 00:14:50,100
♪We can never embrace again♪

250
00:14:50,540 --> 00:14:55,180
♪If rain has tears,
wash away the dust of fate♪

251
00:14:55,740 --> 00:14:57,180
♪By lamplight, I turn the page♪

252
00:14:57,700 --> 00:15:00,100
♪The ink dries, and there you are♪

253
00:15:00,620 --> 00:15:01,940
♪Gone to ash in a flash♪

254
00:15:02,540 --> 00:15:03,660
♪Like a blade through my heart♪

255
00:15:04,140 --> 00:15:07,180
♪Too late to pull away♪

256
00:15:07,700 --> 00:15:09,580
♪The song ends, and all have gone♪

257
00:15:10,020 --> 00:15:13,740
♪Now we must part♪

258
00:15:14,220 --> 00:15:17,340
♪Flowers burn the ground,
yet vows are held so lightly♪

259
00:15:17,900 --> 00:15:20,740
♪The song ends.
Where shall I seek you in dreams♪

260
00:15:21,340 --> 00:15:23,060
♪By the window, a dying candle♪

261
00:15:23,540 --> 00:15:27,980
♪Whose shadow do I yearn for♪
